Source: owe
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Armbian <info@armbian.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkgconf,
 libwayland-dev, libwayland-bin, wayland-protocols,
 libegl-dev, libgles-dev, libgl-dev, libepoxy-dev,
 libmpv-dev, libavformat-dev, libavcodec-dev, libavutil-dev, libswscale-dev,
 libsystemd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/omacom/owe

Package: owe
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, socat
Description: wallpaper and theme renderer for Wayland
 owe draws the desktop wallpaper and the theme transitions of the Omarchy
 desktop on Wayland compositors with the layer shell protocol. The owed
 daemon renders; the owe command controls it.
